\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sl276\slmult1\fs16 Filter out the new Bitdefender VHDs\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Filter disallowed characters in local account names\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve Microsoft Dev Drive detection (courtesy of Martin Kuschnik)\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve the pre-formatting partition cleanup code\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve error reporting on ISO extraction issues\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve detection of drives with long hardware IDs (typically SSDs)\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve conflicting process reporting\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve support for Nutanix and umbrelOS ISOs\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix a TOCTOU vulnerability in Fido script execution (CVE-2026-2398, reported by @independent-arg)\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix replacement vulnerabilities for diskcopy.dll and oscdimg.exe\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix FFU image creation being erroneously invocated, when trying to save an ISO image\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix saving of ISO images to paths that contain spaces\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Update UEFI:NTFS and UEFI DBXs to latest\par

